{"id":"glatt","lemma":"glatt","pos":"adj","rank":2807,"glosses":["without roughness or unevenness: smooth; sleek, slick; even; clean (of a shave or cut); straight (of hair)","slippery (from e.g. ice, but not from grease)","smooth (without difficulty, problems, or unexpected consequences or incidents)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1c/De-glatt.ogg/De-glatt.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"glatter","superlative":"am glattesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Alles geht glatt mit unserem Plan.","en":"Everything is going well with our plan.","words":[{"g":"everything"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"project"}]},{"text":"Das ist nicht glatt.","en":"That isn't fair.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/45651","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Ihre Haut ist glatt.","en":"Her skin is smooth.","words":[{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"skin"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Der Boden ist sehr glatt.","en":"The floor is very slippery.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"ground, soil"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Das hatte ich glatt vergessen.","en":"I'd completely forgotten that.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to forget"}]}]}